{{Quote|A double-edged sword with powers of the night and the ability to create portals.|Item}}
The '''Midnight Blade''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Known for its stunning visuals, the Midnight Blade is still considered to be a fairly decent sword for grinding in the [[Second Sea]]. 

In PvP however, it is recommended that the player upgrades to a better sword as they progress out of the [[Second Sea]] and enter the [[Third Sea]], due to its moves infamously known for being extremely easy to [[Instinct]]-trick and punish.

==Obtainment==
The Midnight Blade can be obtained at the cost of {{Ectoplasm|100}} [[Ectoplasm]] from [[El Admin]].

